{"compatibility":"as-is","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: as-is.

Protected data: `y`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

No changes were required. The protected observation `y` is a top-level data variable and is observed exactly once with a plain built-in sampling statement. Context inputs `N` and `sigma` are not scored as observations. Parameters `a` and `b` each have exactly one built-in prior before any later model-block use.
","model_safe_stan":"data {
  int<lower=1> N;      // Number of observations
  array[N] real y;           // Observations
  real<lower=0> sigma; // Measurement variability
}

parameters {
  real a;
  real b;
}

model {
  // Prior model
  a ~ normal(0, 1);
  b ~ normal(0, 1);

  // Observational model
  y ~ normal(a, sigma);
}

","data_safe_json":"{"N":5,"sigma":1.076446129197262,"y":[4.0,5.0,3.0,3.0,2.0]}","protected_variables":["y"]}
